The primary record identifies version 2, 2024 and 21 pages; checked on 29 October 2026. This is a specific consortium document, not an assertion that version 2 is forever the newest version or that it is a universally binding law. Check actual title-page contributors, component notices and the intended jurisdiction/application. Public institutional access is not a blanket CC licence. No specification, model or test data is copied here.

